s and use your special abilities to lead them to their true selves\u2014completely immersed, with nothing left to hold you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/dd62429a0eae0782323aa9cc3d65cb7b.poster.avif?t=1761806826\" width=1600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/dd62429a0eae0782323aa9cc3d65cb7b.webm?t=1761806826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/dd62429a0eae0782323aa9cc3d65cb7b.mp4?t=1761806826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/03b2bcd608ae5ada6dd9728c6704c1b4.poster.avif?t=1761806826\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/03b2bcd608ae5ada6dd9728c6704c1b4.webm?t=1761806826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/03b2bcd608ae5ada6dd9728c6704c1b4.mp4?t=1761806826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/3088564a913b06b962e0bab91c561f0d.poster.avif?t=1761806826\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/3088564a913b06b962e0bab91c561f0d.webm?t=1761806826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/3088564a913b06b962e0bab91c561f0d.mp4?t=1761806826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration System</strong><br>The city is shrouded in mist. Use your perception abilities to gradually uncover the map and uncover your targets\u2019 inner thoughts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Lock &amp; Analysis</strong><br> Observe each character\u2019s inner thoughts and daily behavior to identify their weaknesses and seize the perfect moment to act.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ability Use &amp; Control Progression</strong><br> Each character has her own weaknesses. Use the right approach to gradually break down her defenses and lead her to accept her true self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk Management</strong><br>If you push too hard and raise the alert level of a region, it may trigger intervention by \u2588\u2588\u2588, hindering your future actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Character Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/12402f0868cd05aa3b513c7261b5735d.poster.avif?t=1761806826\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/12402f0868cd05aa3b513c7261b5735d.webm?t=1761806826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/12402f0868cd05aa3b513c7261b5735d.mp4?t=1761806826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Character</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hana\uff5cIdol</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/89da6aa3baec18d259439722feb14358.avif?t=1761806826\" width=720 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u300c<i>As long as I keep smiling, no one will notice I'm about to break.</i>\u300d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A popular idol admired by the public, but inwardly crumbling. Desperate for dependency yet obsessed with control. Once her defenses fall, she will spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0Sasaki Haruka\uff5cHousewife</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/8670b646255c1f91ff328f57a8116e22.avif?t=1761806826\" width=720 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u300c<i>This home, this responsibility\u2026 am I truly content?</i>\u300d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A gentle and devoted homemaker hiding an unspeakable emptiness. Longing to be understood, yet afraid to take the first step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Momoka\uff5cStore Clerk</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/a21f7e86663d6dae21380f36213720e2.avif?t=1761806826\" width=720 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u300c<i>You think I fall for stuff that easily? Ehehe \u2665</i>\u300d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A lively girl working two part-time jobs. She appears carefree but is extremely sensitive to &quot;special attention.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supporting Character</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Aya Hayashi\uff5cResearcher</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/a42a2d52982172554f49891961cdb3c7.avif?t=1761806826\" width=720 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u300c<i>...What exactly are you?</i>\u300d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0A genius scientist with a deep fascination for all things abnormal. The most dangerous threat to any anomaly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TsukumoMabuchi\uff5cBar Madam</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/5537a296a532a85d46cc42e86849d5c4.avif?t=1761806826\" width=720 height=404 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Played by Tsukumo Mabuchi, a sensual VTuber from \u300c\u82a5\u5ddd\u7d44 Akutagawa\u300d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u300c<i>Your eyes... are quite intriguing.</i>\u300d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A calm, mysterious mature woman with wide-reaching connections. The hazy nights, when she's most relaxed, offer the perfect opportunity to breach her defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YukinoshitaOriyuki\uff5cMasseuse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/f608ba666c35555024415049c73ad756.avif?t=1761806826\" width=720 height=404 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Played by Yukinoshita Oriyuki, a sensual VTuber from \u300c\u82a5\u5ddd\u7d44 Akutagawa\u300d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u300c<i>Want to know where your stress comes from?</i>\u300d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">An expert in guiding emotions through scent and touch, but mentally unstable\u2014making her a high-risk, easily influenced target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/20c8716ef39e6246c362c3e1eea5350b.poster.avif?t=1761806826\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https:/